# Raw race-result exports from the game server.
#
# These are dropped here to be uploaded through the admin Giveaway tab; they
# must never be committed. Alongside the results they carry a full <Stream>
# block of in-race chat between real drivers, which is private conversation we
# have no reason to publish. The parser discards it, and the test fixtures in
# skf-site/backend/tests/fixtures/ are stripped copies kept deliberately small.
#
# Pattern matches the game's own naming: 2026_09_05_21_29_13-02R1.xml
[0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9]_[0-9][0-9]_[0-9][0-9]_*.xml

.DS_Store
